["Tripp County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/south-dakota/tripp-county"],["ARC or PLC in Tripp County","/arc-plc/south-dakota/tripp-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 13 grids in Tripp County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, and February to March came in under 90% of normal in 38 of them. In 2025, January to February came in at 38% of normal on the middle of the grids, while August to September hit 144%. So far in 2026, February to March sits at 26% and June to July at 127% on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
